  "install_text": "**SM-WT**\n\nTemperature and humidity meter supporting SHT40 and DS18B20 sensors.\n\n**Measured Parameters**\n- Temperature (°C) — SHT40 or DS18B20\n- Relative Humidity (%rH) — SHT40 only\n- Wi-Fi Signal Strength (dBm)\n\nThe device transmits a JSON object with 3 or 4 fields depending on the sensor. All values are sent as strings.",
